odd Eulerian/Worpitzky leg: O(x)=A_3(x)=x^2+4x+1
odd roots=(-2-sqrt(3), -2+sqrt(3)) ~= (-3.732050807569, -0.267949192431)
strict_interlacing: -4 < -2-sqrt(3) < -1 < -2+sqrt(3)
Wronskian orientation:
